{
  "nl": "对公账户管理（antd 风格）：查询有开户名称；表格展示开户名称、银行类型、开户支行、账号；支持新增、编辑、删除。表单里「开户支行」的可选项随「银行类型」变化——国有银行给工行/建行，股份制银行给招商/兴业。",
  "nlEn": "Corporate-account management (Ant Design look): query by account name; the table shows account name, bank type, branch and account number; supports add, edit and delete. In the form the \"branch\" options follow \"bank type\" — state-owned banks offer ICBC/CCB, joint-stock banks offer CMB/CIB.",
  "fixedFields": [
    "accountName",
    "bankType",
    "branch",
    "accountNo"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "reactions:branch",
    "target"
  ],
  "config": {
    "name": "CorporateAccountManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/corporate-accounts",
    "target": "antdv",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "accountName",
        "label": "开户名称",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "bankType",
        "label": "银行类型",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "国有银行",
            "value": "state"
          },
          {
            "label": "股份制银行",
            "value": "joint"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "branch",
        "label": "开户支行",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "bankType"
            ],
            "when": {
              "==": [
                {
                  "var": "bankType"
                },
                "state"
              ]
            },
            "fulfill": {
              "dataOptions": [
                {
                  "label": "工行",
                  "value": "icbc"
                },
                {
                  "label": "建行",
                  "value": "ccb"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "bankType"
            ],
            "when": {
              "==": [
                {
                  "var": "bankType"
                },
                "joint"
              ]
            },
            "fulfill": {
              "dataOptions": [
                {
                  "label": "招商银行",
                  "value": "cmb"
                },
                {
                  "label": "兴业银行",
                  "value": "cib"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "accountNo",
        "label": "账号",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "AI-07: 分支式 dataOptions 联动（antdv/schema）。2026-10-29 标签改回 NL 原词（工行/建行）：原文写全称「中国工商银行/中国建设银行」，而 NL 只给简称 ⟹ 缩写→全称的展开不可推断，等于把这一行钉成不可过"
}
